Package: libntk1-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libntk1 (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends}
Suggests:
 ntk-fluid
Description: development files for NTK
 NTK is a lightweight GUI toolkit derived from FLTK.
 .
 This package contains the headers, static libraries, pkg-config files
 and symbolic links required for developing applications using NTK.

