Package: libntk1-images1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: NTK GUI toolkit image library
 NTK is a lightweight GUI toolkit based on FLTK.
 This package contains the shared library for image handling used by
 applications built with NTK.

